# Terraform: never commit local state, plan output, or anything with
# secrets in cleartext. State lives on the faissprod azurerm backend
# (see backend.tf).
#
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (per HashiCorp guidance) so provider
# versions stay reproducible across machines.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
*.tfplan
# Captured plan/apply transcripts from local iteration — keep out of git.
*.out
